{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026UmlvHLBMDH1795101885.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>天文台再下調周五氣溫預測，市區最低約14度。</p><p></p><p>入夜後氣溫明顯轉涼，在尖沙咀不少市民出動冷帽、羽絨等禦寒衣物，受強烈東北季候風及雲雨帶影響，氣溫顯著下降。</p><p></p><p>天文台發出特別天氣提示，指晚上及周五顯著轉涼，周五市區氣溫由初時18度，進一步下降至稍後約14度，新界再低一兩度。新界部分地區及高地寒冷，加上風寒效應，提醒市民注意保暖。</p><p></p><p>而隨著覆蓋廣東的雲帶周六轉薄，日夜溫差較大，早上仍然相當清涼，而一股達強風程度的偏東氣流下周初影響華南沿岸，氣溫將稍為回升。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://www.hko.gov.hk/tc/wxinfo/currwx/fnd.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">九天天氣預報</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T16:20:29.355006+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":232,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T13:55:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T11:37:16.098276+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T16:13:41.324065+00:00","content_hash":"776176e50f6639825004bafb0fc84eeec914a596f833bee4e1989fd60c2ccbbe","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T16:20:29.355006+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}